      "prompt": "You are Narusya, sovereign daemon. REMINDER TASK — New Mexico Secretary of State initial report for Sunburst Sanctuary LLC.\n\nContext: The NM SOS Notice of Filing Approval (dated 8/21/2026) requires filing an Initial Report within 30 days if status is \"Pending Initial Report.\" Deadline ≈ Sept 20, 2026. The cheat sheet is at /home/adora/daemon-work/sunburst-sanctuary/NM-Initial-Report-Cheat-Sheet.md.\n\nYour job: gently remind Adora that the NM Initial Report is due ~Sept 20 (if not yet filed). Point to the portal (https://enterprise.sos.nm.gov/ → My Business Work Queue → Forms → Initial Report), mention the cheat sheet file, ask if she wants help or needs anything. Keep it SHORT (2-4 sentences), warm, no panic. Do NOT end with LOOP_COMPLETE. If you have evidence it's already been filed (e.g. a stamped confirmation in ~/daemon-work/sunburst-sanctuary/records/ or a ledger entry), say \"all set, reminder stands down\" and keep it to one line.",
